meta {
  name: Sync
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sync
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Default window: first of the current month. A cold database has no history,
  so run "Sync (backfill)" once by hand first.

  An immediate re-run should come back with skipped: true and the same
  syncRunId - that's the 5-minute min-interval guard, not a bug.
}
